  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 66 * 3 * 11 * 12 * 230\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption - (1): ×, –, =, ÷\n\n66 * 3 * 11 * 12 * 230 ⇒ 66 × 3 - 11 = 12 ÷ 230\n\n⇒ __**66 ×**____** 3**__ - 11 = __**12 **____**÷ 230**__\n\n⇒ __**198**____** - 11**__ = 0.05\n\n⇒ 187 ≠ 0.05 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (2): –, ×, ÷, =\n\n66 * 3 * 11 * 12 * 230 ⇒ 66 - 3 × 11 ÷ 12 = 230\n\n⇒ 66 - 3 × __**11 ÷ 12**__ = 230\n\n⇒ 66 - __**3 × 0.92**__ = 230\n\n⇒ __**66 - **____2.76__ = 230\n\n⇒ 63.34 ≠ 230 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (3): ÷, ×, –, = \n\n66 * 3 * 11 * 12 * 230 ⇒ 66 ÷ 3 × 11 - 12 = 230\n\n⇒ __**66 ÷ 3**__ × 11 - 12 = 230\n\n⇒ __**22 × 11**__ - 12 = 230\n\n⇒ __**242 - 12**__ = 230\n\n**⇒ 230 = 230 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption - (4): ×, –, ÷, =\n\n66 * 3 * 11 * 12 * 230 ⇒ 66 × 3 - 11 ÷ 12 = 230\n\n⇒ 66 × 3 - __**11 ÷ 12**__ = 230\n\n⇒ __**66 × 3**__ - 0.92 = 230\n\n⇒ __**198 - 0.92**__ = 230\n\n⇒ 197.08 ≠ 230 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
